# Cube exported for the OBJModel tests
mtllib cube.mtl
o Cube
v -1.0 -1.0 1.0
v 1.0 -1.0 1.0
v 1.0 1.0 1.0
v -1.0 1.0 1.0
v -1.0 -1.0 -1.0
v 1.0 -1.0 -1.0
v 1.0 1.0 -1.0
v -1.0 1.0 -1.0
vt 0.0 0.0
vt 1.0 0.0
vt 1.0 1.0
vt 0.0 1.0
vn 0.0 0.0 1.0
vn 0.0 0.0 -1.0
vn 1.0 0.0 0.0
vn -1.0 0.0 0.0
vn 0.0 1.0 0.0
vn 0.0 -1.0 0.0
usemtl Material
s off
f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1 4/4/1
f 6/1/2 5/2/2 8/3/2 7/4/2
f 2/1/3 6/2/3 7/3/3 3/4/3
f 5/1/4 1/2/4 4/3/4 8/4/4
f 4/1/5 3/2/5 7/3/5 8/4/5
